sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Classification
    participant S as Switch use_memory
    participant PG as PostgreSQL
    participant AI as AI Agent

    C->>S: decision + questionType
    alt USE_MEMORY = true
        S->>PG: Profil, historique, identité KODA
        PG-->>S: Contexte personnel
        S->>AI: Réponse mémorielle
    else NO_MEMORY
        S->>PG: 100 conversations (+ insert si nouvelle info)
        PG-->>S: Contexte dialogue
        S->>AI: Réponse générale
    end
    AI-->>S: JSON output
